### Confirmar API e acesso ao PostgreSQL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Listar cursos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/degree-courses

### Criar curso (não repetir se já iniciou o perfil demo)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/degree-courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "EI",
  "name": "Engenharia Informatica",
  "totalCredits": 180
}

### Criar estudante
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "2026002",
  "name": "Maria Exemplo",
  "institutionalEmail": "maria@example.org",
  "enrolledYear": 1,
  "degreeCourseCode": "EI"
}

### Listar estudantes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Consultar um estudante
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2026002
